; The fennec `.mlx` PRE-PASS: a source→source lexer that turns fennec-flavoured JSX (bare text
; children + {expr} interpolation) into the quoted-text + (expr) form the mlx grammar accepts. The
; in-process `fennec mlx-pp` (../prepass/cli, Fennec_mlx_cli) runs this, then parses the result with
; the VENDORED mlx parser (../prepass/vendor). Stdlib-only (no ppxlib, no parser link), so this leaf
; stays tiny and fast on the per-file hot path.
;
; Kept as its OWN leaf library (fennec_mlx_prepass) so the exhaustive unit-test suite can link the
; transform directly, and both the CLI engine and the merlin reader build on it.

(library
 (name fennec_mlx_prepass)
 (modules fennec_mlx_prepass))
